<span id="S4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para"><img src="2602.22785v1/fig/edge.png" id="S4.SS2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/138;" width="264" height="138" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span>
<span id="S4.F5" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<span class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span><span id="S4.F5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative Ablation Studies on the Edge–Regularized Assignment Cost.</span></span>
